# K0004: Invalid Escape

An unrecognized escape sequence was found inside a string literal.

Backslashes (`\`) inside strings introduce special character escapes. Any character following `\` that is not a valid escape code triggers this error.

Example of erroneous code:

```kura
let path = "C:\users\kura\ui.kura";
```

Supported escape sequences in Kura strings:
- `\n` (newline), `\r` (carriage return), `\t` (tab)
- `\\` (literal backslash) and `\"` (literal double quote)
- `\0` (null character)

To represent a literal backslash, escape the backslash itself:

```kura
let path = "C:\\users\\kura\\ui.kura";
```
